*\r\n    * Users can input anime titles into the search bar, and Nekonite will retrieve relevant results from the Jikan API.\r\n    * The search functionality is designed to be intuitive, allowing for partial or full title searches.\r\n* **Detailed Anime Information:**\r\n    * Upon selecting an anime, users are presented with a detailed overview, including:\r\n        * Synopsis: A brief summary of the anime's plot.\r\n        * Genres: Categorization of the anime by genre (e.g., action, comedy, drama).\r\n        * Status: Current status of the anime (e.g., airing, completed).\r\n        * Score: Rating of the anime based on user reviews.\r\n        * And other relevant data provided by the Jikan API.\r\n* **User-Friendly Interface:**\r\n    * Nekonite features a clean and modern design, ensuring a pleasant user experience.\r\n    * The layout is optimized for both desktop and mobile devices, providing accessibility across various platforms.\r\n    * The use of Javascript to consume the API, allows for a dinamic web page.\r\n* **Technology Stack:**\r\n    * The application is built using standard web technologies:\r\n        * HTML: For structuring the content of the web pages.\r\n        * CSS: For styling and layout.\r\n        * JavaScript: For handling user interactions and fetching data from the Jikan API.\r\n    * The Jikan API serves as the backend, providing a reliable source of anime data.\r\n\r\n**Future Enhancements:**\r\n\r\n* Implement user interface improvements.\r\n* Add features like related animes.\r\n* Add the option to see the characters of the animes.\r\n\r\nNekonite aims to be a valuable resource for anime fans, providing easy access to information and enhancing the anime discovery experience.", "created_at": "2025-03-13T16:45:10Z", "repo": "AnimeApp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "185fde1a3137d735408fe53580d230bf5e793c9f", "message": "Update index.html", "created_at": "2025-03-13T16:36:53Z", "r