ption\r\n\r\nQuiabeir is a meticulously crafted landing page that aims to capture the essence of a vibrant Brazilian dining experience in the heart of New York City. This project focuses on creating an immersive online presence for a fictional restaurant, showcasing its unique culinary offerings and inviting atmosphere.\r\n\r\n**Key Features and Functionality:**\r\n\r\n* **Visually Engaging Design:**\r\n    * The landing page is designed with a strong emphasis on visual appeal, utilizing high-quality images and a cohesive color scheme to reflect the warmth and vibrancy of Brazilian culture.\r\n    * The layout is thoughtfully structured to guide visitors through the restaurant's key offerings, from menu highlights to location details.\r\n* **Comprehensive Menu Showcase:**\r\n    * Featured dishes are presented with mouth-watering images and detailed descriptions, enticing visitors to explore the restaurant's culinary delights.\r\n    * This section aims to provide a glimpse into the authentic flavors of Brazilian cuisine.\r\n* **Restaurant Ambiance and Details:**\r\n    * Information about the restaurant's location, contact details, and ambiance is clearly presented, ensuring visitors have all the necessary information.\r\n    * Special attention is given to conveying the restaurant's unique atmosphere, making visitors feel as if they are already stepping inside.\r\n* **Interactive Map Integration:**\r\n    * An embedded Google Maps feature allows visitors to easily locate the restaurant, enhancing the user experience and providing practical information.\r\n* **Responsive and Accessible Design:**\r\n    * The landing page is designed to be fully responsive, ensuring optimal viewing across various devices, including desktops, tablets, and smartphones.\r\n    * The page also follow the most modern web accessibility standards.\r\n* **Technology Stack:**\r\n    * This project is built using fundamental web technologies:\r\n        * HTML: For structuring the content of the landing page.\r\n        * CSS: For styling and creating the visual design.\r\n    * This combination ensures a lightweight and efficient user experience.\r\n\r\n**Project Goals:**\r\n\r\n* To create a compelling online presence that effectively promotes the fictional Quiabeir restaurant.\r\n* To provide a user-friendly and visually appealing platform for potential customers to learn about the restaurant.\r\n* To demonstrate proficiency in HTML and CSS for web development.\r\n\r\nQuiabeir aims to provide a delightful online experience that mirrors the warm and inviting atmosphere of a traditional Brazilian restaurant.", "created_at": "2025-03-13T16:53:07Z", "repo": "Quiabeir", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "97a353f5c30af8d80a4d4de221f4ff1cd96f384b", "message": "Update index.html", "created_at": "2025-03-13T15:58:53Z", "repo": "Quiabeir", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3095084ed0e9519fcc4e69eb65e29c9528c08a06", "message": "Update style.css", "created_at": "2025-03-12T22:15:33Z", "repo": "Quiabeir", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6386d77e632ee5f0250c65b763bbb3ce1f73c4ce", "message": "Update index.html", "created_at": "2025-03-12T22:11:25Z", "repo": "Quiabeir", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6515b3d1e56c8b7fdf9e0a8d1cd3a88265795ca2", "message": "Update style.css", "created_at": "2025-03-12T22:10:50Z", "repo": "Quiabeir", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "62b90d2f9c33935cac2928b9d2eacd314c87b14d", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2025-03-12T21:57:21Z", "repo": "Quiabeir", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "67fa25f4044a4ce77e71c246e4691d109d377460", "message": "Delete resta directory", "created_at": "2025-03-12T21:55:52Z", "repo": "Quiabeir", "file_sampled": false, "has_test